\vspace{0.6cm}

The graph has vertices $\{a,b,c,d,e\}$ and the following edges:

\begin{center}
\begin{tabular}{llll}
$e_1$: $a$--$b$ & $e_2$: $a$--$d$ & $e_3$: $d$--$b$ &
