          diagonal all \textbf{zero} (simple graph).
    \item Incidence (undirected): every column sum
          $= \mathbf{2}$.
    \item Incidence (directed): every non-loop column sum
          $= \mathbf{0}$.
    \item Both: row sum of $v_i$ $=$ $\deg(v_i)$.
\end{itemize}

